<node id="Group at Dhamek Stupa, Sarnath, India during Educational Travel Vlog (image)">
  <data key="d0">Group at Dhamek Stupa, Sarnath, India during Educational Travel Vlog (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">A travel group poses in front of the Dhamek Stupa in Sarnath, India, amid lush gardens, for a vlog documenting educational travel across Indian cities from 2023.12.27 to 2024.01.10. Image reflects cultural interaction and tourism.</data>
